  "description": "A vulnerability was detected in AirAsia MOVE App up to 12.47.1 on Android. This issue affects the function com.airasia.core.utils.RealPathUtil.getRealPath of the component com.airasia.mobile. Performing a manipulation of the argument _display_name results in path traversal. The attack requires a local approach. The exploit is now public and may be used. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.",
